{"id":"e664edf227d0e59a","group":"43","path":"43/43-thm-randomhierarchy.md","title":"基础随机性层级","display":"thm-randomhierarchy — 基础随机性层级","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity","book_abbrev":"43","label":"43-thm-randomhierarchy","aliases":["43-thm-randomhierarchy"],"display":"thm-randomhierarchy — 基础随机性层级","depends_on":["[[43-df-kurtzrandom]]","[[43-df-schnorrrandom]]","[[43-df-comprandom]]","[[43-df-mlrandom]]","[[43-df-nrandom]]"],"source_edition":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, draft 2007-07-28","source_location":"§10.4.1 Theorem 10.4.7，印刷221，PDF241；§10.5.1，印刷233–235，PDF253–255；§9.7，印刷189–191，PDF209–211","source_scope":"book","verification_status":"formalization-reviewed","source_proof_checked":false},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"43"},{"key":"label","html":"43-thm-randomhierarchy"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>43-thm-randomhierarchy</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-randomhierarchy — 基础随机性层级"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"1b1a52dd1295c33c\" href=\"?note=1b1a52dd1295c33c\" title=\"43-df-kurtzrandom\">43-df-kurtzrandom</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"c8d43a74ea8721f3\" href=\"?note=c8d43a74ea8721f3\" title=\"43-df-schnorrrandom\">43-df-schnorrrandom</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"52fd5856a06d2543\" href=\"?note=52fd5856a06d2543\" title=\"43-df-comprandom\">43-df-comprandom</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"0586e0fd0301d605\" href=\"?note=0586e0fd0301d605\" title=\"43-df-mlrandom\">43-df-mlrandom</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"86bdc33f83ee57a9\" href=\"?note=86bdc33f83ee57a9\" title=\"43-df-nrandom\">43-df-nrandom</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, draft 2007-07-28"},{"key":"source_location","html":"§10.4.1 Theorem 10.4.7，印刷221，PDF241；§10.5.1，印刷233–235，PDF253–255；§9.7，印刷189–191，PDF209–211"},{"key":"source_scope","html":"book"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"formalization-reviewed"},{"key":"source_proof_checked","html":"false"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p>设 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\\in2^\\omega\">\\(X\\in2^\\omega\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb N_{&gt;0}\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb N_{&gt;0}\\)</span>；各随机性谓词见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"1b1a52dd1295c33c\" href=\"?note=1b1a52dd1295c33c\" title=\"43-df-kurtzrandom\">43-df-kurtzrandom</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"c8d43a74ea8721f3\" href=\"?note=c8d43a74ea8721f3\" title=\"43-df-schnorrrandom\">43-df-schnorrrandom</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"52fd5856a06d2543\" href=\"?note=52fd5856a06d2543\" title=\"43-df-comprandom\">43-df-comprandom</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"0586e0fd0301d605\" href=\"?note=0586e0fd0301d605\" title=\"43-df-mlrandom\">43-df-mlrandom</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"86bdc33f83ee57a9\" href=\"?note=86bdc33f83ee57a9\" title=\"43-df-nrandom\">43-df-nrandom</a>。</p>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ComputableRandom}\">\\(\\mathrm{ComputableRandom}\\)</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"2^\\omega\">\\(2^\\omega\\)</span> 上的布尔谓词，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"52fd5856a06d2543\" href=\"?note=52fd5856a06d2543\" title=\"43-df-comprandom\">43-df-comprandom</a>。\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{KurtzRandom}\">\\(\\mathrm{KurtzRandom}\\)</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"2^\\omega\">\\(2^\\omega\\)</span> 上的布尔谓词，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-12\" data-note=\"1b1a52dd1295c33c\" href=\"?note=1b1a52dd1295c33c\" title=\"43-df-kurtzrandom\">43-df-kurtzrandom</a>。\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{MLRandom}\">\\(\\mathrm{MLRandom}\\)</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"2^\\omega\">\\(2^\\omega\\)</span> 上的布尔谓词，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-13\" data-note=\"0586e0fd0301d605\" href=\"?note=0586e0fd0301d605\" title=\"43-df-mlrandom\">43-df-mlrandom</a>。\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Random}_n\">\\(\\mathrm{Random}_n\\)</span> 是由正整数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span> 索引的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"2^\\omega\">\\(2^\\omega\\)</span> 上布尔谓词族，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-14\" data-note=\"86bdc33f83ee57a9\" href=\"?note=86bdc33f83ee57a9\" title=\"43-df-nrandom\">43-df-nrandom</a>。\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SchnorrRandom}\">\\(\\mathrm{SchnorrRandom}\\)</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"2^\\omega\">\\(2^\\omega\\)</span> 上的布尔谓词，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-15\" data-note=\"c8d43a74ea8721f3\" href=\"?note=c8d43a74ea8721f3\" title=\"43-df-schnorrrandom\">43-df-schnorrrandom</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\left(\\mathrm{MLRandom}(X)\\Rightarrow\\mathrm{ComputableRandom}(X)\\right)\\land\\left(\\mathrm{ComputableRandom}(X)\\Rightarrow\\mathrm{SchnorrRandom}(X)\\right)\\land\\left(\\mathrm{SchnorrRandom}(X)\\Rightarrow\\mathrm{KurtzRandom}(X)\\right).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\left(\\mathrm{MLRandom}(X)\\Rightarrow\\mathrm{ComputableRandom}(X)\\right)\\land\\left(\\mathrm{ComputableRandom}(X)\\Rightarrow\\mathrm{SchnorrRandom}(X)\\right)\\land\\left(\\mathrm{SchnorrRandom}(X)\\Rightarrow\\mathrm{KurtzRandom}(X)\\right).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Random}_{n+1}(X)\\Rightarrow\\mathrm{Random}_n(X).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{Random}_{n+1}(X)\\Rightarrow\\mathrm{Random}_n(X).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>第一链的每一包含严格，分离见独立原子；第二链由预言机强度单调性。链式蕴含按相邻两项的合取解释。</p>\n<p>来源：§10.4.1 Theorem 10.4.7，印刷221，PDF241；§10.5.1，印刷233–235，PDF253–255；§9.7，印刷189–191，PDF209–211。书内定位仅适用用户提供的2007-07-28草稿；本地补充另行注明。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"43-df-kurtzrandom","status":"resolved","id":"1b1a52dd1295c33c","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-kurtzrandom]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-schnorrrandom","status":"resolved","id":"c8d43a74ea8721f3","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-schnorrrandom]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-comprandom","status":"resolved","id":"52fd5856a06d2543","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-comprandom]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-mlrandom","status":"resolved","id":"0586e0fd0301d605","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-mlrandom]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-nrandom","status":"resolved","id":"86bdc33f83ee57a9","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-nrandom]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-kurtzrandom","status":"resolved","id":"1b1a52dd1295c33c","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"设 $X\\in2^\\omega$，$n\\in\\mathbb N_{>0}$；各随机性谓词见 [[43-df-kurtzrandom]]、[[43-df-schnorrrandom]]、[[43-df-comprandom]]、[[43-df-mlrandom]]、[[43-df-nrandom]]。","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-schnorrrandom","status":"resolved","id":"c8d43a74ea8721f3","anchor":"ref-7